DTSTAMP:20260722T105545Z
DTSTART:20260724T200000Z
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you
	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Ti
	ckets\nResale Tickets \nJeff Dunham: Artificial Intelligence LIVE at Emera
	ld Queen Casino\nComedy superstar Jeff Dunham is bringing his record-break
	ing Artificial Intelligence tour to the Emerald Queen Casino Event Center 
	in Tacoma\, WA. Known for his hilarious cast of puppet characters\, Dunham
	 delivers a one-of-a-kind comedy experience that has made him one of the b
	est-selling stand-up comedians of all time. Don’t miss this unforgettable 
	night of laughs on July 24\, 2026! \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\, July 24
	\, 2026\nTime: 8:00 PM (Doors open at 7:00 PM)\nVenue: Emerald Queen Casin
	o Event Center\nAddress: 2920 East R Street\, Tacoma\, WA 98404\nAge Requi
	rement:\nParking: Ample parking available in multiple garages at EQC Tacom
	a \nAbout Jeff Dunham\nJeff Dunham is one of the most successful stand-up 
	comedians in the world\, known for his unique blend of ventriloquism and c
	omedy. His beloved characters — including Walter\, Peanut\, Achmed the Dea
	d Terrorist\, and Bubba J — have made him a household name. Dunham holds t
	he Guinness World Record for the most tickets sold for a stand-up comedy t
	our and has sold out arenas across the globe. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHilariou
	s ventriloquism featuring Jeff’s iconic puppet characters\nNew material fr
	om the Artificial Intelligence tour\nA world-class comedy performance in a
	n intimate casino event center setting\nFull bar service available (21+ ev
	ent)\nState-of-the-art sound and lighting at the EQC Event Center\nAn even
	ing of non-stop laughs for comedy fans of all backgrounds\n\nVenue Informa
	tion\nThe Emerald Queen Casino Event Center is a state-of-the-art event sp
	ace with stadium seating for 1\,800+ guests\, located at EQC Tacoma — just
	 20 miles south of SeaTac Airport. The venue features six dining options\,
	 a sports bar\, and ample parking in multiple garages. \nTicket Informatio
	n\nTickets go on sale to the general public on April 3\, 2026. Artist pre-
	sale runs April 1–3\, 2026. There is a ticket limit of 8 tickets per perso
	n. All sales are final. This is a 21+ event — valid photo ID required for 
	entry. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate l
	inks. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no
	 extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. V
	alid photo ID may be required for entry.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/eve
	nt/jeff-dunham-artificial-intelligence-live-at-emerald-queen-casino/\n\nFr
	om Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/jeff-dunham-artificial-intelligence-li
	ve-at-emerald-queen-casino/
