DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you
	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Ti
	ckets\nResale Tickets \nJoe Kilgallon LIVE at CG’s Comedy Club\nJoe Kilgal
	lon brings his sharp\, straight-shooting stand-up comedy to CG’s Comedy Cl
	ub in Bolingbrook for a night of laughs. Described by the Chicago Tribune 
	as having “a straight shooting\, no-nonsense style\,” Kilgallon is a Chica
	go comedy favorite. \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\, July 24\, 2026\nTime: 
	8:00 PM\nVenue: CG’s Comedy Club\nAddress: 619 E. Boughton Rd.\, Ste. 125\
	, Bolingbrook\, IL 60440\nAge Requirement: 21+ (Valid ID required)\nPhone:
	 (630) 410-8906 \nAbout Joe Kilgallon\nJoe Kilgallon is a Chicago-based st
	and-up comedian known for his sharp wit and relatable observational humor.
	 Praised by the Chicago Tribune for his straight-shooting style\, Kilgallo
	n has built a loyal following in the Chicago comedy scene and beyond. His 
	performances are consistently praised for their clever writing and natural
	 stage presence. \nWhat to Expect\n\nSharp\, observational stand-up comedy
	\nIntimate comedy club setting at CG’s Comedy Club\nFull bar service avail
	able\nShow starts at 8:00 PM sharp\n21+ event — valid photo ID required\nG
	reat night out in the Bolingbrook/Chicago suburbs\n\nVenue Information\nCG
	’s Comedy Club is located at 619 E. Boughton Rd. in Bolingbrook\, IL\, a p
	opular comedy destination in the Chicago suburbs. The club features a full
	 bar and an intimate showroom atmosphere perfect for live stand-up comedy.
	 \nTicket Information\nTickets are available through Ticketmaster and Vivi
	dSeats. All shows are 21 and up. Contact the venue at (630) 410-8906 for m
	ore information. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains a
	ffiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our l
	inks at no extra cost to you.\nAll sales are final. Show times subject to 
	change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.\n\nhttps://comedycalenda
	r.com/event/joe-kilgallon-live-at-cgs-comedy-club/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
